# Image build context of the hand-off package s1b-handoff (ADR-004 section 5a, 1b.9f): an ALLOW-LIST, as the E8 package's. Everything is excluded, then exactly what the chain programs, the test sets and the scripts need is
# let back in. BuildKit reads this file next to the Dockerfile when the build is started from the repository root with -f:
#   docker build -f docs/refactoring/suffix-tree-upgrade/analysis/s1b-handoff/Dockerfile .
# Nothing of .git (history, remotes, configuration), wiki, other docs or any bin / obj directory enters the image or the build cache.
*
# the programs: the Bench application (sesa resume build, sesa handoff), the prototype's verifier and generator (e8-verify, e8-gen), and the libraries they use
!apps/SuffixTree.Esa.Bench
!apps/SuffixTree.EmProto
!src/SuffixTree/Directory.Build.props
!src/SuffixTree/Algorithms
# the test sets of the owner's CI policy: Esa (default, Exhaustive, Fuzz, checked), EmProto, Persistent, with the files they read from the repository
!tests/SuffixTree/Directory.Build.props
!tests/SuffixTree/SuffixTree.Esa.Tests
!tests/SuffixTree/SuffixTree.EmProto.Tests
!tests/SuffixTree/SuffixTree.Persistent.Tests
!docs/refactoring/suffix-tree-upgrade/analysis/s1b/harness_member_coverage.tsv
!docs/refactoring/suffix-tree-upgrade/analysis/bench/MANIFEST.sha256
# the repository's props and style rules: the TEST build uses them as they are (the Sonar analyzer package is restored from nuget.org at image build time); the chain build replaces the props (see the Dockerfile)
!Directory.Build.props
!Directory.Packages.props
!Seqeron.sln
!.editorconfig
# the scripts of this package, the shared helpers of the E8 package, the generators of the benchmark
!docs/refactoring/suffix-tree-upgrade/analysis/s1b-handoff
!docs/refactoring/suffix-tree-upgrade/analysis/e8
!docs/refactoring/suffix-tree-upgrade/analysis/bench/gen/gen_inputs.py
# whatever sits inside the allowed directories and must not enter: build output, the owner's returned data, the mutation work
**/bin
**/obj
**/mutation
**/__pycache__
docs/refactoring/suffix-tree-upgrade/analysis/e8/results
docs/refactoring/suffix-tree-upgrade/analysis/e8/*.tsv
docs/refactoring/suffix-tree-upgrade/analysis/e8/*.txt
docs/refactoring/suffix-tree-upgrade/analysis/s1b-handoff/results
